{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_15","type":"agent_message","text":"The core mechanics now pass real Rapier tests, including head bumps, crab armor, stun recovery, damage, and the boss. A scripted run also clears all five shifts. Testing caught two bugs already: restarting could retain a shift timer, and reward coins were collected before their pop animation could be seen; both are fixed.\n"}}
